    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified under regulation 30 of the Wages Boards Regulations, that Mr. U. C. Perera and Mr. R. G. Walpola havebeen appointed as Workers' Representative and Employer's Representative, respectively of the Wages Board for the TeaGrowing and Manufacturing Trade by the Hon. Minister of Labour under Section 9 of the Wages Boards Ordinance(Chapter 136). This appointment is valid only up to 01.01.2018.",
